"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"2ao0GD9qmbF6XjhfqDlkvg","review_id":"HUhIcFVXB7BaMiA5qGFL7g","date":"2020-08-08T01:51:34","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9218007326126099,"text_excerpt":"Love this place. It's a bakery with Pho and other great Vietnamese cuisine. The crawfish pie is to die for. Have to get there early because they go go go. The folks are friendly and accommodating. Yes, the baked good are fresh and sooooo good. Just don't let my doctor know. Remember to support your local busines"},{"business_id":"2ao0GD9qmbF6XjhfqDlkvg","review_id":"8tn3oKUZu6FIF7v6b2cUHw","date":"2019-06-08T00:37:26","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.902825117111206,"text_excerpt":"Thank you for opening in Lakeview. We enjoyed the Banh Mi & Thor Nnong tonight and look forward to sampling the remaining menu items soon. All of our dishes delicious."},{"business_id":"2ao0GD9qmbF6XjhfqDlkvg","review_id":"LJIm0ixoF2y-8F7Pasn6Sg","date":"2019-12-12T02:11:39","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.8995956182479858,"text_excerpt":"I love this new location! I love the decor and ambience. Wow! There were so many different kinds of desserts in the case! I will be back to try a few. We just had a quick bite to eat. The staff was very nice and helpful. I loved the coconut shrimp. The shrimp were crispy and so tasty. My mango avocado chicken salad was da bomb! I think it's my new favorite salad ever."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"2ao0GD9qmbF6XjhfqDlkvg","photo_id":"aTQzDnbI3i6fKqtr-QUmdw","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/aTQzDnbI3i6fKqtr-QUmdw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9217407703399658},{"business_id":"2ao0GD9qmbF6XjhfqDlkvg","photo_id":"nA2n-U727istRWNjEa1QAA","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/nA2n-U727istRWNjEa1QAA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7902920246124268},{"business_id":"2ao0GD9qmbF6XjhfqDlkvg","photo_id":"jxZGQ9JRfzrCOoIHHxGBFA","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/jxZGQ9JRf